From b6b2b23117fc86cb1084882a370ddc4a4a9df129 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IronWolve <3938589+IronWolve@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:11:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/45] Make the song details compact: Song, Sound and Shape
 side by side

One card of three rows: Song | Sound | Shape, then Sliders | LoRAs with each strength beside its name, then the two seeds stacked with copy buttons. Length and render time stay on the line under the title only, and Style influence shows its position without the guidance text (a hover gives it). In a narrow window Shape drops under Song and Sound.
---
 tools/console/app.css | 58 +++++++++++++++++++---------------
 tools/console/app.js  | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------
 2 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 1349706..6e92db0 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -1209,36 +1209,46 @@ pre.paper { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65; white-space: pre-wrap; word-br
